  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added `OpType::Engrave` to `do_not_touch_applies` in `crates/app/src/operation/types/avoid.rs` so the Boundaries panel shows \"Pick protected\" for Engrave operations.\n- Added `crates/motion/src/machining2d/trace_avoid.rs` so Engrave keeps flutes, shank, and holder clear of protected faces and edges across cutting moves, plunges, retracts, and rapid links.\n- Kept baseline toolpaths identical when `AvoidSpec` is empty, refused blocked cuts by protected item name, and updated MCP tool descriptions in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` and `docs/agents/mcp-tools.md`.\n- Addressed review findings: added `trace_avoid_rotates_closed_loop_seam_around_overhead_plunge_blocker` in `crates/motion/tests/avoid_engrave.rs`, set `do_not_touch.rs` harness height to `1200.0`, added pinning tests in `crates/app/tests/do_not_touch_engrave.rs`, and added `docs/decisions/3349-engrave-do-not-touch.md`.\n- Merged `upstream/main` and kept both `Face` and `Engrave` in `avoid.rs`, `tools.rs`, `mcp-tools.md`, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/do_not_touch.rs`.\n\n## Verification\n\nVerified on head `70239a58ada714a958d38328fad9c12a639fd3fd` under `PROCESS_VERSION 135`:\n\n- `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-motion --lib --test avoid_engrave --test avoid_pocket`: `lib` 542 passed, 0 failed, 10 ignored; `avoid_engrave` 4 passed, 0 failed; `avoid_pocket` 3 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-app --lib --test do_not_touch --test do_not_touch_engrave --test do_not_touch_project --test engrave_law`: `lib` 297 passed, `do_not_touch` 3 passed, `do_not_touch_engrave` 3 passed, `do_not_touch_project` 3 passed, `engrave_law` 10 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-app --test mcp --test mcp_doc_drift --test verify --test example_catalog_adaptive --test example_catalog_edge_work`: `mcp` 23 passed, `mcp_doc_drift` 6 passed, `verify` 21 passed (2 ignored), `example_catalog_adaptive` 1 passed, `example_catalog_edge_work` 1 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog`: 35 passed, 4 ignored, 2 failed (`catalog_2d_drill_overfeed::regenerates` and `catalog_2d_drill_overfeed::rebuilds` fail on Windows with `core.autocrlf = true` due to `\\n` vs `\\r\\n` on untouched `examples/catalog/2d/drill-overfeed/refusal.txt`).\n- `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-ui --lib -- --test-threads=1`: 1463 passed, 0 failed, 8 ignored; both `egui_app::tests::do_not_touch::face_op_shows_pick_protected_button` and `egui_app::tests::do_not_touch::engrave_boundaries_shows_do_not_touch_controls_and_takes_picks` passed.\n- `cargo clippy -j 10 -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (exit 0).\n- `cargo xtask gate light` (`CAMCRAFT_GATE_JOBS=10`, `CAMCRAFT_NO_SCCACHE=1`): passed (3 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled; wall 3.1 min).\n- Trial merge against `upstream/main` (`5346bd7ac5ff5d734e1772e7015837d79fe39d52`): clean (`git merge-tree --write-tree` exit 0).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Interactive desktop click session (exercised through `egui_kittest`).\n\nfork synced at v0.25.0\nChangelog: Engrave operations now support Do not touch protection surfaces (UI, MCP, project roundtrip, and motion avoidance).\nEffort: high\n\nFixes #3349\n",
